title: Cave.Battle
---
Molly: Is that a centipede...bear?
Molly: What??
Molly: Why can't anything in this place just be normal?? 
King's Ghost: Sadly whatever calamity has befallen the land has twisted and corrupted the familiars absolutely.
Molly: Gross.
Molly: Well, let's get this over with.
Molly: And hope I don't die in the process!
===
title: Cave.Fear
---
<<SetExpression idle smile>>
Molly: Caves are pretty cool to explore...
<<SetExpression surprise surprise>>
Molly: ...when there isn't a giant eyeball monster guarding them.
<<SetExpression surprise annoyed>>
Molly: So I think I'll just keep moving along.
===
title: Cave.Start
---
Molly: Oooh, this places is actually kinda cool!
Molly: Look at those glowing crystals!
Molly: Too bad there's some messed up thing lurking around in here that would eat me in a heartbeat, right?
King's Ghost: Absolutely.
Molly: Fabulous.
Molly: Ok let's take a look around and try not to get eaten.
